{
  "$defs": {
    "BBox": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "页面坐标（PDF user space，原点左下）。用于 Web 端原文高亮。",
      "properties": {
        "x0": {
          "title": "X0",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "y0": {
          "title": "Y0",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "x1": {
          "title": "X1",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "y1": {
          "title": "Y1",
          "type": "number"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "x0",
        "y0",
        "x1",
        "y1"
      ],
      "title": "BBox",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ChannelReading": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "单个解析通道对某字段的读数 —— 用于多路表决与溯源展示。",
      "properties": {
        "channel": {
          "enum": [
            "text_layer",
            "ocr",
            "vlm",
            "table_engine",
            "manual"
          ],
          "title": "Channel",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "raw_text": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Raw Text"
        },
        "page": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Page"
        },
        "bbox": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/BBox"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null
        },
        "confidence": {
          "default": 0.0,
          "maximum": 1.0,
          "minimum": 0.0,
          "title": "Confidence",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "note": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Note"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "channel"
      ],
      "title": "ChannelReading",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ConfidenceAdjustment": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "reason": {
          "title": "Reason",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "delta": {
          "maximum": 1.0,
          "minimum": -1.0,
          "title": "Delta",
          "type": "number"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "reason",
        "delta"
      ],
      "title": "ConfidenceAdjustment",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ConfidenceBreakdown": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "置信度的可复算明细 —— 必须原样输出到报告与 Web 面板。\n\n加分项：评审可以逐项质疑并自行重算。禁止只给一个黑盒分数。",
      "properties": {
        "base": {
          "maximum": 1.0,
          "minimum": 0.0,
          "title": "Base",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "adjustments": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/ConfidenceAdjustment"
          },
          "title": "Adjustments",
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "base"
      ],
      "title": "ConfidenceBreakdown",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "DocumentManifest": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一份原始材料的登记信息。SHA256 是后续一切可复现性的根。",
      "properties": {
        "doc_id": {
          "title": "Doc Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "filename": {
          "title": "Filename",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "rel_path": {
          "description": "相对于 data/raw/ 的路径，禁止绝对路径入库",
          "title": "Rel Path",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "sha256": {
          "title": "Sha256",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "page_count": {
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Page Count",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "doc_type": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/DocumentType",
          "default": "unknown"
        },
        "issued_date": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Issued Date"
        },
        "registered_at": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Registered At",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "has_text_layer": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Has Text Layer"
        },
        "page_routes": {
          "additionalProperties": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/PageRoute"
          },
          "description": "页码(1-based) -> 路由决策",
          "title": "Page Routes",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "route_reasons": {
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "description": "页码 -> 路由判定理由（可追溯要求）",
          "title": "Route Reasons",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "parser_backend": {
          "default": "pymupdf",
          "description": "pymupdf | pypdfium2",
          "title": "Parser Backend",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ocr_engine": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Ocr Engine"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "doc_id",
        "filename",
        "rel_path",
        "sha256",
        "page_count"
      ],
      "title": "DocumentManifest",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "DocumentType": {
      "enum": [
        "announcement",
        "annual_report",
        "semi_report",
        "quarter_report",
        "prospectus",
        "research_draft",
        "comps_table",
        "unknown"
      ],
      "title": "DocumentType",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "EvidenceSpan": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "证据锚点 —— 事实与原文之间的唯一桥梁。\n\n``quote`` 是硬闸门：入库前必须能回原文匹配成功（见 verify.quote_check）。",
      "properties": {
        "span_id": {
          "title": "Span Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "doc_id": {
          "title": "Doc Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "chunk_id": {
          "title": "Chunk Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "page": {
          "minimum": 1,
          "title": "Page",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "bbox": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/BBox"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null
        },
        "quote": {
          "description": "原文连续片段，必须逐字可回读",
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Quote",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "char_range": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "maxItems": 2,
              "minItems": 2,
              "prefixItems": [
                {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              ],
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Char Range"
        },
        "source_layer": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/SourceLayer"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "span_id",
        "doc_id",
        "chunk_id",
        "page",
        "quote",
        "source_layer"
      ],
      "title": "EvidenceSpan",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "Fact": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "事实库的一条记录 —— 全项目唯一的数字真源。\n\nR4 的假设依据、R5 的比对基准都从这里取。任何下游模块\n**不得自行解析原始文档**，只能消费本结构。",
      "properties": {
        "fact_id": {
          "title": "Fact Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "doc_id": {
          "title": "Doc Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "entity": {
          "description": "主体，如公司名或股票代码",
          "title": "Entity",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "metric": {
          "description": "指标规范名，见 configs/metrics.yaml",
          "title": "Metric",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "value": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Value"
        },
        "unit": {
          "description": "归一化后的单位：元/万元/亿元/%/股/万股/倍/元每股…",
          "title": "Unit",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "raw_text": {
          "description": "页面上原样出现的字符串，禁止改写",
          "title": "Raw Text",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "period": {
          "description": "报告期，如 2025A / 2025H1 / 2025Q3 / 2025-06-30",
          "title": "Period",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "period_type": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/PeriodType",
          "default": "unknown"
        },
        "statement_scope": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/StatementScope",
          "default": "unknown"
        },
        "profit_basis": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ProfitBasis",
          "default": "unknown"
        },
        "source_layer": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/SourceLayer"
        },
        "evidence_span_ids": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "title": "Evidence Span Ids",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "channel_readings": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/ChannelReading"
          },
          "title": "Channel Readings",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "confidence": {
          "maximum": 1.0,
          "minimum": 0.0,
          "title": "Confidence",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "confidence_breakdown": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ConfidenceBreakdown"
        },
        "needs_review": {
          "default": false,
          "title": "Needs Review",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "review_reason": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Review Reason"
        },
        "extractor": {
          "description": "prompt_id@version 或 rule_engine@version",
          "title": "Extractor",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "extracted_at": {
          "description": "抽取时间。**复现流水线会统一传入 run 的 started_at**，否则同一输入两次运行的时间戳不同，产物哈希无法一致。",
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Extracted At",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "fact_id",
        "doc_id",
        "entity",
        "metric",
        "value",
        "unit",
        "raw_text",
        "period",
        "source_layer",
        "evidence_span_ids",
        "confidence",
        "confidence_breakdown",
        "extractor"
      ],
      "title": "Fact",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "PageRoute": {
      "description": "逐页路由决策（configs/routing.yaml 驱动）。",
      "enum": [
        "A_text_only",
        "B_scanned",
        "C_garbled",
        "D_table",
        "E_mixed"
      ],
      "title": "PageRoute",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "PeriodType": {
      "enum": [
        "point_in_time",
        "duration_ytd",
        "duration_single_q",
        "duration_fy",
        "unknown"
      ],
      "title": "PeriodType",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "ProfitBasis": {
      "description": "利润口径 —— R5 的 E2/E3 依赖此字段。",
      "enum": [
        "net_parent",
        "net_parent_ex_nonrec",
        "net_total",
        "unknown"
      ],
      "title": "ProfitBasis",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "SourceLayer": {
      "description": "事实的来源层 —— 直接决定基础置信度。",
      "enum": [
        "L1_text_layer",
        "L2_ocr",
        "L3_vlm",
        "L4_manual",
        "computed"
      ],
      "title": "SourceLayer",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "StatementScope": {
      "description": "报表口径 —— R5 的 E3「统计口径」错误依赖此字段。\n\n★ 为什么需要 ``SEGMENT_TOTAL`` / ``SEGMENT_DETAIL``（2026-09 第十三轮新增）\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n分部报告的列头是**业务分部名 + 合计**，不是期间：\n\n    |（行标签）  | 油气和新能源 | 炼油化工和新材料 | … | **合计** |\n    | 分部收入   | 824,808     | 1,078,043      | … | 4,882,272 |\n    | 资本性支出 | 205,094     | 47,772         | … | **269,089** |\n\n其中 ``合计`` 列与分部列**语义完全不同**：合计列的 269,089 就是集团口径的\n资本开支，而 205,094 只是勘探与生产板块的。但在补齐这两个值之前，\n提取器只能把它们全部标成 ``consolidated`` —— 同表同期同主体，于是被\n``store._check_internal_conflict`` 判为\"多口径冲突、需人工判定\"，\n集团合计因此**取不出来**（第十一轮实测：12 条 capex 候选全部 need_review）。\n\n第十二轮按单元格坐标重建列结构之后，``合计`` 列的位置可以被稳定定位，\n于是\"按取值落在哪一列定口径\"成为可做的事 —— 这就是这两个值的来源。\n\n⚠️ ``SEGMENT_TOTAL`` 与 ``CONSOLIDATED`` 在**经济含义上等价**\n（都是集团整体），但**来源不同**：前者来自分部报告的合计列，\n后者来自合并报表。刻意分成两个值而不是合并成一个，理由有二：\n\n1. **可追溯**：报告里能说清这个数是\"分部报告合计列\"还是\"合并报表\"，\n   审计时可以分别核对 —— 合并成一个值就永久丢失了这个信息。\n2. **不静默合并**：两者数值可能不一致（口径调整、重述），\n   合并成一个值会让这种不一致消失。保持分离，让它在冲突守卫里显形。\n\n下游凡是判断\"是不是集团口径\"的地方，**两个值都要算**（见\n``r4_valuation.assumptions._caliber_rank`` 与\n``domain.tools.audit_rules._caliber_rank_local``）。",
      "enum": [
        "consolidated",
        "parent_only",
        "segment_total",
        "segment_detail",
        "unknown"
      ],
      "title": "StatementScope",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "一次 R1 运行的完整产物 —— 写入 runs/<id>/facts/facts.json。",
  "properties": {
    "contract_version": {
      "default": "1.0.0",
      "title": "Contract Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "run_id": {
      "title": "Run Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "built_at": {
      "description": "构建时间。**复现时必须传入 run 的 started_at**，否则两次运行的产物哈希无法一致，『可复现』无从证明。",
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "Built At",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "documents": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/DocumentManifest"
      },
      "title": "Documents",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "facts": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/Fact"
      },
      "title": "Facts",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "evidence": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/EvidenceSpan"
      },
      "title": "Evidence",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "needs_review_count": {
      "default": 0,
      "title": "Needs Review Count",
      "type": "integer"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "run_id"
  ],
  "title": "FactSet",
  "type": "object"
}
